hadiths[3]{hadithnumber,text}:
"70","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: ""Qul ya ayyuhal kafiroon"" Quran ke chauthe hisse ke barabar hai."
"71","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne Fajr ki do rak'aton mein ""Qul ya ayyuhal kafiroon"" aur ""Qul huwal lahu ahad"" parhi."
"72","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Mas'ood se riwayat hai ke unhone kaha: Main gin nahin sakta ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam se kitni baar suna ke aap Maghrib ke baad ki do rak'aton mein aur Fajr ki namaz se pehle ki do rak'aton mein ""Qul ya ayyuhal kafiroon"" aur ""Qul huwal lahu ahad"" padhte the."
